{"parse": {"title": "DSF-6", "pageid": 89663, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DSF-5\" title=\"DSF-5\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DSF-6</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DSF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">6</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A7.AF.E9.9B.AA.E4.B9.8B.E4.B8.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"积雪之上\">积雪之上</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 积雪之上</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Above the Snow</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>这是我最后听得清的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>在这之后，我的意识就像是小爱兹拉一样，变成了投身于雪山的一片雪花——消失得无影无踪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋摊开双手，无奈地耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>得了吧，你留给了他一瓶药剂，你的意思已经够明显了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你醒来之后——那个试管呢，它还在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>当然不在了，爱兹拉又不是个傻孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>他失去了拉普拉斯的批准，没了技术支持和靠山，如果他还想回去那座雪山，并且爬得更高、更远，就必须借助我的药剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你这是把他推向一条险境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻姑娘低下头，调整着制服袖口，就好像那些纤维正不断地瘙弄着她的皮肤似的坐立不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你是他的朋友，你不应该——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我和他做朋友的方式，就是给他提供帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>就像他和我做朋友的方式一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……据我所知，今天稍早一些的时候，有一支急救小队前往了雪山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么？那是去找爱兹拉的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我想是的。但是向上报备这项需求的人并不是爱兹拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>干嘛这么看着我，他都一夜没回来了，也是时候通知那些人去捞他了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我的药剂能支撑他在山上四处乱跑，直到他找见那朵该死的雪绒花，但毕竟是首次调配出的试验用药，如果他爬得太高，很可能在半山腰就没了力气——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女孩：</div><div>哇——快看那儿！刚刚发言的姐姐又回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子的惊呼打断了拉普拉斯员工们的谈话，展馆中的人们循声望去，馆长助手推着一辆手推车走向展厅中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻女性站定身体，扶正了挂在脸颊一侧的麦克风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">馆长助手：</div><div>首先，我必须向各位参展者致歉。今日的馆长演讲环节已经取消。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">馆长助手：</div><div>我们的新任馆长因为身体情况不佳，正在拉普拉斯附属医院进行治疗，很遗憾，无法在第一时间与各位见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">馆长助手：</div><div>但是，爱兹拉馆长仍旧为我们带来了一个无与伦比的好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笼罩在手推车上的黑色绒布被扯下，露出其下轮廓方正的生态箱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那是……爱兹拉的菌菇生态箱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>哈！那是雪峰火绒草！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯职员Ⅰ：</div><div>天啊！我听说过他想收集这个，没想到他真的能做到——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯职员Ⅱ：</div><div>迄今为止可没有任何室内展览成功展出过雪峰火绒草，连先前圣洛夫基金会举行的世界植物展都只展示了它的标本！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯职员Ⅱ：</div><div>学界一度认为它是无法离开雪山的，这……我不会是在做梦吧……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群惊叹不断，喧闹声响成一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本驻足于各个展品之前的人们也动身聚集向展馆中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没人不想去见证一个正在发生的奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女孩：</div><div>嗯……？这个牌子是什么呀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这是介绍标牌，小妹妹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X弯下腰，将小姑娘护住，以免她被拥挤的人群推搡得跌倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>从口吻来看，它出自于我朋友的手，也就是带来这朵花的人，这场展览的策展人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女孩：</div><div>啊！我知道他，我爷爷和我说过这个人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小姑娘用双手在头上比划出了一个蘑菇的形状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女孩：</div><div>他有时会戴着一顶帽子，一顶蘑菇帽子，我记得他的帽子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女孩：</div><div>我还没和他说过话呢，我一直想和他说说话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>也许你可以先看他写的东西，它们就在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一张手稿纸，平静地摆放在生态箱旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它被雪水打湿后又被烘干，颜色略微发灰，与雪白的花朵相对，如同一层灰暗的影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X与女孩将它拾起，人们这才看见它的存在。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“雪峰火绒草，也称雪绒花，菊科火绒草属植物。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“与其他火绒草不同，普遍生长于海拔3000米至3800米的高原与山脉地区。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“它具有燃烧性，是很好的引火材料，因此被称为火绒草。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“与此同时，如同雪花一般的白色，又为其斩获了雪绒花的称号。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“我的母亲带我认识了这种花朵，她告诉我，在我的家乡，这种花寓意着：和平、稳定、真正的相互理解。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“在雪域地区的历史中，他们认为这种花朵来自于一个理想的、无人所知、无人可见的国度。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“在那个国度中，没有纷争，人与人相爱，相互平等，相互尊敬。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“而雪绒花，是那国的使者，从窗沿的缝隙走入我们的世界。生长着雪绒花之处，便是与理想之国接壤的土地。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“我们无从得知传说的起源，更无法验明那‘无人所知、无人可见的国度’是否存在。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“但毫无疑问，雪绒花之上寄托着人们对于和平、相互理解、相爱与相互尊敬的诚挚期待。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“而这，也是这场展览真正的主题。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“有双眼的人，都可看见花的美丽；有双手的人，都可接触枝叶的绿意。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-307401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“有血液流淌的人，都可行走；有心脏跳动的人，都可相互爱戴。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“从今天开始，从此时开始。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>“理想的国，将接壤雪山之下的土壤，火绒草引领的星火，燃燃不熄灭。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DSF-6"}}